OpenPAM for ravynOS
===================

openpam/ is OpenPAM 20230627 ("Ximenia"), the PAM implementation macOS
ships, unmodified except that the autotools files, tests and tools were
left out. Licence: BSD-3-Clause (openpam/LICENSE).

  Source:  https://download.sourceforge.net/openpam/openpam-20230627.tar.gz
  SHA-256: 0d9ac8f5b55a6241f5073f13eff1e95461422c45ac1a30445d7e1068e91db4fd

Our files: Makefile (bmake, in place of configure and automake) and
config.h. What is installed, as on macOS:

  /usr/lib/libpam.2.dylib, libpam.dylib     the library
  /usr/include/security/*.h                 the API (pam_appl.h, openpam.h...)
  /usr/lib/pam/pam_<name>.so.2              modules: unix, permit, deny, return
                                            and FreeBSD's group, rootok, self
                                            (freebsd-modules/, BSD-3, for su)

Policies are read from /etc/pam.d/. To upgrade, replace openpam/ with the
new release's lib, include, modules and doc/man and check the list of
sources in Makefile against lib/libpam/Makefile.am.
